0..74 Comment "/// A stuck call passed to a parameter meets the call its parameter\'s type"
75..86 Comment "/// writes."
87..90 Comment "///"
91..176 Comment "/// `composedHere`\'s type writes `Path.step(p, q)` over its parameters. Each `passed`"
177..257 Comment "/// declaration passes it paths, and states the type with those paths written in"
258..338 Comment "/// place. A variable reads alike in both. A call to `onPath` does not reduce on"
339..411 Comment "/// a variable path, so `composedHere`\'s type must read it as that call."
412..415 Comment "///"
416..489 Comment "/// The checker decides a pure call a type reads to stand as the value it"
490..564 Comment "/// returns. The instantiated type reads the argument in that form, as the"
565..638 Comment "/// stated type writes it. The kernel replays each declaration by its own"
639..651 Comment "/// reading."
652..655 Comment "///"
656..731 Comment "/// - see: #4065 — the checker refused a stuck call passed to a parameter"
732..801 Comment "/// - see: #4038 — a composite by a definition over stuck endpoints"
802..854 Comment "/// - see: #720 — a call argument\'s form in a type"
856..932 Comment "/// The action of `F` on `p`, which does not reduce while `p` is a variable."
